<title>HUNGARY: Graboplast group Q1 '97 after-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Graboplast group Q1 '97 after-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	445.4	 vs     346.5</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  581.9	 vs     257.9</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	475.5	 vs     215.5</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     4,019.6	 vs   3,142.3</p>
<p>     Domestic sales	     1,626.6	 vs   1,259.7</p>
<p>     Export sales		 2,393.0	 vs   1,882.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue		    84.1	 vs	37.1</p>
